{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfY25muhaied6v9F4L8fA","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"{\"statements\":[{\"statement_id\":\"S1\",\"role\":\"finding\",\"observation_ids\":[\"O471\",\"O472\"],\"text\":\"The cafe card terminal declined every payment after lunch. Cash sales carried on normally.\"},{\"statement_id\":\"S2\",\"role\":\"diagnosis\",\"observation_ids\":[\"O473\"],\"text\":\"The payment provider says the terminal declined cards because our merchant account was suspended over an unpaid fee.\"},{\"statement_id\":\"S3\",\"role\":\"next_step\",\"observation_ids\":[\"O474\"],\"text\":\"Clear the balance and ask the provider to reinstate the account.\"}],\"conclusion\":\"insufficient_evidence\"}"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":662,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":409,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":195},"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"diagnostics":null}